{"ID":"20240118151307-1urnhvm","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151307-1urnhvm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151307-1urnhvm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151307-0m74jbx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094944-bk93xqm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094944-bk93xqm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:120,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:120\u0026#125;","title":"082石龙刍chú（龙须草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903102715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151307-0m74jbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151307-0m74jbx","updated":"20240122094931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦微寒，主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼注，恶毒，久服补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。一名龙须草。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094934-dpxrysp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094934-dpxrysp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生长泽地，产山西河南一带，茎以九节多珠者良。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094937-mz0w9if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094937-mz0w9if"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦性微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094939-8nkrdpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094939-8nkrdpf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】龙须草为泻心经之热，通利小肠膀胱要药，主治小便不通，小便带血；茎中热痛及淋闭。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094940-10jmzq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094940-10jmzq5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】补内虚不足痞满，身无润泽。出汗。除茎中热痛，疗疣虫肿不消食。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094942-n8oprs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094942-n8oprs0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094943-nsuw2o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094943-nsuw2o0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】小便不通不因于热者勿用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094931-x22qink","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094931-x22qink"}},{"ID":"20240122094944-pkwgjxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094944-pkwgjxc"}},{"ID":"20240122094944-bk93xqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094944-bk93xqm","updated":"20240129164356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第82味药，是石龙刍，现在叫龙须草，这个龙须草是泄心经的药，泄心经心脏，这个心经的热，能够通利小肠，跟我们一些像黄柏啊，还有前面的利膀胱的利小便的药，通通可以，功能差不多，使用功能都差不多啊。一般张仲景，他没有用到这个龙须草，徐长卿他都不会用，他都没有用到这些，像淋病，小便里面带血你们都看到，按照书上看就可以了，这都属于寒凉性的药。"}]}]}